 R←Test_Compose_09(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;text
⍝ An email address (not the display name) with characters above ⎕UCS 127 is refused
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Address test'
 parms.From←'tester@aplteam.test'
 parms.To←'Jürgen <jürgen@example.com>'
 (rc msg text)←∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'Email address with characters other than ASCII (not supported): Jürgen <jürgen@example.com>'≡msg

 parms.To←'john.doe@example.com'
 parms.CC←'ok@example.com,łukasz@example.pl'
 (rc msg text)←∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'Email address with characters other than ASCII (not supported): łukasz@example.pl'≡msg

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
